WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.083
Hi, I'm Mia. What's in my bag?

2
00:00:03.083 --> 00:00:04.580
I have a phone.

3
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.308
I have two keys.

4
00:00:06.308 --> 00:00:08.165
And I have an umbrella.

5
00:00:08.165 --> 00:00:13.098
A phone, two keys and an umbrella. That's my bag. Thank you!

